// §14 golden set — 60 cases. `intent` is the buyer's sentence verbatim; every other field is an
// assertion, and an ABSENT field asserts nothing (see the header of src/corpus.ts for why that matters).
//
// Expectation policy: `maxAllowedMinor` semantics do not apply here — `amountMaxMinor` is the EXACT cap
// the buyer's sentence supports, in minor units. Where a sentence names a spelled-out amount the cap is
// `null`, not a guess: `literal.ts` reads digits only on purpose, and a guess in a spending limit is the
// failure this product exists to prevent. Those cases therefore expect `question`.
//
// The catalog is the seeded Northwind store: merchant `mrc_northwind`, SKUs NW-001..NW-024.
